# The Lost Book (crystalWar 26), the rival at Quu Bokye (Giddeus; no script, default 56): a level 30 Warrior there with
# a Mythril Beastcoin, The Lost Book accepted at Prog 1 and Dark Legacy (Bastok, C#) accepted at Prog 2 (GMs; missions
# as the main flow): Dark Legacy answers him with 61 (an Event) and trades a Yagudo Cherry for 62. 64 (Progress) over
# 61, twice; the beastcoin: 65 (Dark Legacy wants the cherry), finished: the book, Prog 2. Prog 2: no section here:
# Dark Legacy's 61, twice (no script: no turn to alternate with).
lists Giddeus/Quu_Bokye/onTrigger Giddeus/Quu_Bokye/onTrade Giddeus/onEventFinish/65
char zone=Giddeus pos=-159.992,17.137,181.502 job=WAR lvl=30
item MythrilBeastcoin
quest CrystalWar.TheLostBook accepted
charvar Quest[7][26]Prog 1
quest Bastok.DarkLegacy accepted
charvar Quest[1][57]Prog 2
mission Wotg BackToTheBeginning current
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
login
trigger Quu_Bokye                       # Prog 1: 64 over Dark Legacy's 61
finish
trigger Quu_Bokye                       # 64 again
finish
trade Quu_Bokye MythrilBeastcoin x1     # 65
finish                                  # the trade confirmed; the Leather-bound Book; Prog 2
trigger Quu_Bokye                       # Prog 2: Dark Legacy's 61
finish
trigger Quu_Bokye                       # 61 again
finish
